'''Spice mine K76''' was a [[mining]] facility in the [[Spice mines of Kessel|spice mines]] of the [[planet]] [[Kessel]]. The [[Galactic Empire]] brought [[Wookiee]] prisoners to mine K76 to harvest [[spice]], but the Wookiees were [[Mission to free Wookiee prisoners|rescued]] by the [[Spectres|rebel]] crew of the ''[[Ghost]]''.<ref name="Spark of Rebellion" />

{{Struct-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|The delay was insignificant. The transport ship agent Kallus diverted will dock on Kessel within two hours. The Wookiees will be offloaded to work spice mine K-seventy-seven.|Imperial officer|<ref name="begins">''[[The Rebellion Begins]]''</ref>}}
In ''[[The Rebellion Begins]]'', the mine is instead identified as "spice mine K-seventy-seven."<ref name="begins" /> The name was repeated in the ''[[Star Wars Rebels Annual 2016]]'' short story "[[The Escape (short story)|The Escape]]," where the mine was referred to as "spice mine K-77."<ref name="The Escape">{{StoryCite|story=The Escape (short story)|book=Star Wars Rebels Annual 2016}}</ref>

